# build cannot take a payment. Everything that costs nothing still works —
# the three free AI highlight reels are deliberately independent of Stripe
# (see billingEnvironmentFor in src/lib/stripe.ts). Add the key here to turn
# checkout and subscriptions back on.
# VITE_PAYMENTS_CLIENT_TOKEN=""
